      {
        "id": 221270,
        "name": "Blackfang108",
        "username": "Blackfang108",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/74df32/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2018-08-16T14:34:18.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"MigrantP\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/migrantp/48/1921_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> MigrantP:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>If it's not fun for you, then why play them?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Honestly, because they're there.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>And it's not that they're not fun for me.&nbsp; It's that&nbsp;I, personally,&nbsp;find them considerably less fun than the non-randomized starts, and higher pressure than just setting the same match up outside of a one-shot.</p>",
